  <item>
    <title>055-能弯腰的女王刘晓庆：低谷是她走过的台阶，所有过往皆为勋章</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1d7ae8ac7bdb080c344991</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1d7ae8ac7bdb080c344991</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 12:35:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期的主题是关于：人生起伏是常态，低谷或许是沉淀的台阶，过往荣辱也皆为勋章；真正的强大是接纳现实、相信自己、敢于弯腰重启，在经历中去成长，在沉淀中蜕变。</span></p><p><span>关键帧：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>— <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a>所有过往皆为勋章</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a>— <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>回顾刘晓庆巅峰过往</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a>— <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a>能重启的核心是“接受”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a>— <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>分享我和老同学的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a>— <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>跨行经历 去重启</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a>— <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a>理性看待坎坷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a>—<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>学会接纳 学会沉淀</span></p><p><span>主播总结🎙️：接纳所有经历，加冕所有过往。</span></p><p><span>全方面了解主播：</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/X3XYeYyWaP" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/X3XYeYyWaP"><span>就这样紫</span></a><span> 公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BX82gYMUjPOfsG8Kdebeyw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BX82gYMUjPOfsG8Kdebeyw"><span>就这样Z</span></a></p><p><span>号外📣</span></p><p><span>【就这样紫】2026第二场线下活动</span></p><p><span>👏正式开启啦👏</span></p><p><span>详情🔎官方公众号</span></p>]]></description>
